  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cash Consortium of Yemen (CCY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCY will implement &apos;Strengthening Coping Capacities of Crisis-Affected Households in Yemen through Multipurpose Cash Assistance&apos; project.  The project aims to protect lives, preserve dignity, and strengthen the coping capacity of 12,647 crisis-affected households by delivering three rounds of lifesaving multipurpose cash assistance to meet urgent food and essential needs across 34 high-severity districts (IPC 4 / HNRP Severity 4) in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
